    question: 'Is SMS 2FA better than nothing?',
    answer: '<p><strong>Yes, SMS is better than no 2FA at all.</strong> However, it\'s the weakest form:</p><ul><li><strong>SIM swapping:</strong> Attackers can convince carriers to transfer your number</li><li><strong>SS7 vulnerabilities:</strong> Technical exploits in phone networks</li><li><strong>Phone theft:</strong> If your phone is stolen and unlocked</li></ul><p>Use SMS 2FA as a stepping stone, but upgrade to authenticator apps or hardware keys for important accounts.</p>'
