  {
    question: 'Should I use 2FA on all accounts?',
    answer: '<p>Enable 2FA on all accounts that support it, but prioritize:</p><ul><li><strong>Critical:</strong> Email (it\'s your recovery point), banking, password manager</li><li><strong>High priority:</strong> Work accounts, cloud storage, social media</li><li><strong>Good to have:</strong> Shopping sites, forums, any account with payment info</li></ul><p>Your email is especially important—if someone compromises your email, they can reset passwords on other accounts.</p>'
