    question: 'How do I set up 2FA on accounts that don\'t obviously support it?',
    answer: '<p>Many sites hide 2FA settings. Look for:</p><ul><li><strong>Security settings:</strong> Usually under Account → Security</li><li><strong>"Login verification":</strong> Some sites use different terminology</li><li><strong>"Two-step verification":</strong> Google\'s term for 2FA</li><li><strong>Search "[site name] 2FA":</strong> Often faster than finding it in menus</li></ul><p>The website <a href="https://2fa.directory" target="_blank" rel="noopener" class="text-jet-stream hover:text-sky-light">2fa.directory</a> lists which sites support 2FA and what methods they offer.</p>'
